{
   "description": "The ISP line in plain terms: up now, ping, packet loss and DNS right now, outages and downtime today, the worst days, and the details. Managed by anvil: change dashboards/internet.jsonnet.",
   "editable": false,
   "panels": [
      {
         "datasource": {
            "type": "datasource",
            "uid": "-- Mixed --"
         },
         "gridPos": {
            "h": 3,
            "w": 24,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
         },
         "id": 1,
         "options": {
            "content": "**Up** means at least one public address (Cloudflare, Google, Quad9) answers a ping. **Ping** is the round trip in milliseconds: under 60 ms is good, over 150 ms feels slow. **Packet loss** above 1% makes calls and games stutter. **Jitter** is how much the ping wobbles. When the router is down too, the problem is at home, not at the ISP. While the lab itself has no power, nothing is measured, so that time is not counted as an outage.\n",
            "mode": "markdown"
         },
         "pluginVersion": "v13.0.0",
         "title": "How to read this",
         "type": "text"
      },
      {
         "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "victoriametrics"
         },
         "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
               "mappings": [
                  {
                     "options": {
                        "0": {
                           "text": "Down"
                        },
                        "1": {
                           "text": "Up"
                        }
                     },
                     "type": "value"
                  }
               ],
               "thresholds": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                     {
                        "color": "red",
                        "value": null
                     },
                     {
                        "color": "green",
                        "value": 1
                     }
                  ]
               },
               "unit": "none"
            }
         },
         "gridPos": {
            "h": 6,
            "w": 4,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 3
         },
         "id": 2,
         "options": {
